"portes, fenêtres, alarme, appareils, lumières. Ce qui manque va à la "
"personne responsable dès le soir même."
msgstr ""
"A tag near the exit. The last person to leave taps it: doors, windows, "
"alarm, appliances, lights. Anything left undone goes to the person in charge"
" that same evening."

